<tab>Barbarians are great warriors dedicated to the service of an ancient cult
Strength and Fury. In this guild, both military merit and magical merit are equally valued,
and the weak in some of these areas will have a hard time here. The barbarians
They have great strength, but not too dexterous. Only brute force attracts
therefore, of the four elements, the Barbarians prefer the most powerful - the earth.
The secret skills of this guild match the power of the Barbarians - they are capable of
enter the berserk state, possess the art of stunning the enemy, so
that he is not able to see or fight, and can also use
special magic to inflict damage to an enemy located at a considerable distance,
It's like he's standing next to me.
